    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d134">

                <pb facs="0201" n="133" xml:id="pg133"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">851.51/6: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Ambassador in Germany</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Gerard</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-09-15">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">September 15, 1914</hi>.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>159. Your No. 40, September 5th, also number 108, eleventh.<anchor n="1"
                        xml:id="d134-f1"/> Inquiry has failed to disclose any attempt to float
                    French loan in this country. Press today reports rumor that German loan of fifty
                    millions is contemplated by certain New York bankers. No confirmation of
                    rumor.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Bryan</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
